<urn:atm:triage:finding/AV-PROD-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV-PROD-002" ;
  triage:title "Reader runtime diagnostics absent from official campaign artifacts: all runtime gauges cli-not-exposed/unimplemented" ;
  triage:description "arch-ctm production-readiness review (msg 01M1D6WRFXDMWFPJ3NHZ02V9ZF, task phase-av-prod-readiness-review, reviewed integrate/phase-av@c330637c2): sprint-AV.4 D5/A6 requires per-campaign queue/wait/execution/deadline/saturation and WAL-health observability. Current official artifacts mark all runtime gauges cli-not-exposed/unimplemented; only CLI-side timing/errors are captured. Diagnostics are transparently absent, not fabricated — does not falsify the PASS, but prevents diagnosing a future floor breach; the 1000ms mixed p95 interim ceiling is the only health signal. arch-ctm's disposition: treat metric export as a named post-merge condition/follow-up, not an invented value. Record as open/important with intended disposition = named follow-up condition on PR #1120, pending Rand's decision." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-av" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "observability" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
